// ---- src/data/maps3.mjs ----
// maps3.mjs — ASH'S JOURNEY recovery file: the content that was lost when
// maps2.mjs truncated mid-write (maps2.mjs closes MAPS2 early at tower2 and
// everything after it — route12 onward — is orphaned, invalid JS).
// This file re-authors the missing span as a self-contained extension:
// Celadon/Saffron gyms + Silph, the east block, Safari + south/west block,
// and the endgame block (Viridian Gym -> League -> post-game), plus the
// TRAINERS3 table those maps reference.
// Shapes match maps.mjs / maps2.mjs EXACTLY. Overrides (viridian / pallet /
// center) are COMPLETE defs meant to replace the maps.mjs entries when
// merged (MAPS3 wins on key collision).
// Tile legend: # tree/wall | . path/floor | , grass | ~ shore water |
//   W deep water | H house | D door | S sign | G gymwall | E gymdoor |
//   C centerdoor | F flower | R rock | T cuttable tree | B boulder | ' ' void
// Encounter extension: { rate, table, waterRate?, water?, cave?, fish? }.
// Events are step-on story triggers; script bodies live in the story file.
// Centers are NOT authored here (except the shared 'center' override):
// 'C' doors warp to the shared 'center' map with a via{} return ticket.

function rows(list) { return list; }

